":[" Run it locally with `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-... python3 bot.py 42` and type"," messages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs"," `COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`).","-Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system","-prompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up","-messages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.","+Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on; see `build_system()`","+for the block layout (static instructions+profile, one block per fact, date last) that","+keeps a `save_fact` from evicting the cached prompt. `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`","+checks the layout offline."]}]}],"moreFiles":2,"changedFiles":["/private/tmp/h-ULZ9U2/ANSWER.md","/private/tmp/h-ULZ9U2/README.md","/private/tmp/h-ULZ9U2/__pycache__/bot.cpython-314.pyc","/private/tmp/h-ULZ9U2/tests/__pycache__/test_cache_layout.cpython-314.pyc"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016JxWnwkumsUT5Ft5ovCELg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
